WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.250
Click the parts button in the repair list.

00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:07.750
The window already contains the repair items chosen at intake.

00:00:07.750 --> 00:00:11.792
Fill in each item without creating the same item again.

00:00:11.792 --> 00:00:15.500
Use the supplier field for items you need to buy.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:17.833
A quote is optional.

00:00:17.833 --> 00:00:22.042
Purchase cost is editable only with financial permission.

00:00:22.042 --> 00:00:26.042
A quote without a supplier does not create a purchase.

00:00:26.042 --> 00:00:28.708
Check the entries and save.

00:00:28.708 --> 00:00:32.292
Items with a supplier enter the purchase cart.

00:00:32.292 --> 00:00:37.875
The cart is only preparation; the website does not place an
order with the supplier.

00:00:37.875 --> 00:00:44.333
After actually ordering from the supplier, open the cart and
select that supplier and the items.

00:00:44.333 --> 00:00:49.917
Use the review button below, check the list, then confirm the
recorded facts.

00:00:49.917 --> 00:00:56.500
Open batch arrivals, choose the supplier and items, then enter
the quantities received in this delivery.

00:00:56.500 --> 00:00:58.792
Review and save.

00:00:58.792 --> 00:01:01.958
Record separate deliveries separately.

00:01:01.958 --> 00:01:06.333
The purchase page shows received quantities and linked repairs.

00:01:06.333 --> 00:01:11.875
When parts arrive, still update the repair and contact the
customer as appropriate.

00:01:11.875 --> 00:01:15.083
These records are not parts inventory.
